WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.060
And I wish I knew that the doctors
weren't going to help me.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.440
Okay, so if we're people listening, can you
give us three things that you wish

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.580
you knew when you first saw your
first bullseye rash?

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.460
If you can think of just many, just a few
things that someone can take away from

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.640
this, if they find a tick on them, three
things that you wish you knew in the

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.440
moment, I wish I knew that I
could get that sick.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.680
I wish I knew that my daughter could be born
with it or my children, and you can

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.500
give it through breast milk. And I wish I knew
that the doctors weren't going to

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.760
help me. I wish I knew I had more faith in
myself to believe in myself

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.420
and not, you know, we've been told our whole
lives that doctors know everything.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.900
Oh, they're the smartest, but they
don't know everything.
